Solution:

Sys.getlocale() # to check whether console is using UTF8

# If not UTF8:

system("locale -a") # find the UTF8 locale you want to use, in my case: "de_DE.UTF-8")

Sys.setlocale("LC_ALL", "<as above>")

Thanks for everybody's help!
Chris

